summary:
Comprehensive Survey of 5,000 Americans Documents Cultural Evolution of Holiday Tables;

Annual Jennie-O 1-800-TURKEYS Hotline Returns Nov. 1

AUSTIN, Minn., Oct. 21, 2025 /PRNewswire/ -- This year, Jennie-O is celebrating a simple truth: There's no single "right" way to do Thanksgiving. Across America, holiday tables tell the story of where families come from—whether that means grandma's green bean casserole recipe that hasn't changed since 1975, or new additions like lumpia, pierogies, or kimc
